.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-export 1  "export " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-export \- Download everything as a zip: items.json, Pages as .md and attachments
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit export\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download everything as a zip: items.json, Pages as .md and attachments
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
Where to write the zip
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit export orbit\-export.zip
  orbit \-\-json export backup.zip
